<opsproc code="00009098.0003001" revdate="2018-08-01T16:29:05"><title><abb>ACT</abb> Auto Transfer System (Manual transfer from the <abb>ACT</abb>(s) to the center tank operative)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.001"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00009098.0003001.002"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.003"><para code="00009098.0003001.001" layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.004">Establish
cockpit to ground communications for the following procedure.</para></inform><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.005" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.002"><challenge>REFUEL PANEL DOOR</challenge><response>OPEN</response></cr-action><comment code="00009098.0003001.003"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.006">The refuel panel door
must be open to check the operation of the manual transfer.</para></comment></action><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009098.0003001.004" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.007" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the center tank is full:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009098.0003001.008"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.009" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ACT</tech-label></challenge><response>CHECK AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.010" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.006"><challenge><tech-label type="sw">TEST</tech-label></challenge><response>SELECT AND MAINTAIN HI. LVL</response></cr-action><comment code="00009098.0003001.007"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.011">Manual fuel transfer
from the <abb>ACT</abb>(s) to the center tank is usually performed
with the center tank not full (center tank high level sensor dry).
Therefore, if the center tank is full, keeping selected the <tech-label type="sw">TEST</tech-label> on the refuel/defuel control panel overrides the high level sensor.</para></comment></action><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.012"><cautionproc code="00009098.0003001.008" layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.013"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.014">Once manual fuel transfer
is checked operative, set immediately the <tech-label type="pb-sw">ACT XFR MODE SEL</tech-label> to <abb>AUTO</abb>. Otherwise, fuel may spill out from the left
tank.</para></cautionproc></inform></procbody></condition><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.015" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.009"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ACT XFR MODE SEL</tech-label></challenge><response>MAN</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.016" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.010"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">ACT XFR</tech-label></challenge><response>Select the 1st <abb>ACT</abb> in sequence <abb>FWD</abb>- <abb>AFT</abb>2 - <abb>AFT</abb>1 that
contains fuel</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.017" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.011"><challenge><tech-label type="s-page">FUEL</tech-label></challenge><response>MONITOR</response></cr-action><comment code="00009098.0003001.012"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.018">Manual fuel transfer
is checked operative when one of the following occurs:</para><unlist bulltype="NDASH" code="00009098.0003001.013" layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.019"><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.020">The <abb>ACT</abb> to center tank fuel transfer indication is fully green</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.021">The fuel quantity
of the selected <abb>ACT</abb> decreases.</para></item></unlist></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.022" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.014"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ACT XFR MODE SEL</tech-label></challenge><response>AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.023" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.015"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">ACT XFR</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.024" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.016"><challenge><tech-label type="sw">TEST</tech-label></challenge><response>RELEASE</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.025" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009098.0003001.017"><challenge>REFUEL PANEL DOOR</challenge><response>CLOSE</response></cr-action></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.026"><title><measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="min">40</measure> AFTER TAKEOFF</title><procbody lid="N.00009098.0003001.042"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.043" memory="false"><command code="00009098.0003001.029"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.044">Apply ACT XFR Fault procedure
(<duref product="QRH" ref="00010826"/>)</para></command></action><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.045"><cautionproc code="00009098.0003001.036" layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.046"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009098.0003001.048">During the manual
transfer, check that the center tank is not full (&lt; <measure category="Weight" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="kg">5750</measure>, <measure category="Weight" show-unit="true" system="US" unit="lb">12680</measure>).</para></cautionproc></inform></procbody></procitem></opsproc>